e="Design rule:\nTilesetRefDto.ImagePath is stored as a RELATIVE path from Vitriol.Projects/.\n\nEditor resolves: ProjectRoot + ImagePath\nRuntime resolves: ProjectRoot + ImagePath\n\nIf the folder is moved, maps still load as long as the internal structure is preserved." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#444444;fillColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530" y="80" width="500" height="260" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>